ht:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">如果你能坚持三个月，你已经超过了99%的旁观者。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">选一个感兴趣的课题，今晚写下你的第一段分析。</p><section style='margin:45px 0 20px 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;'><section style='font-size:13px;color:#999;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase;'>TAGS</section><section><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>AI安全</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>职业转型</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>思维模型</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>科技趋势</span></section></section></section><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzk57DCmhVC16o9ILH0Tn1YPEiarfLRRQSVFN2mJdeYibGnBPialPIzvojw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'></section>",
